  "design": {
    "idea": "Octagonal warp-rail arena for The Thread-Keeper: ignite its active rail's west spool to burn its silk curtain and drop it center-floor, cut its P2 frost-silk wire, claim the Brass Shuttle, and exit north onto r2's NW balcony (Cycle 1).",
    "kind": "boss",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Using rail-fire ignition and P2 wire-cutting against The Thread-Keeper to earn the Brass Shuttle dungeon power.",
    "decisions": 6,
